            <ArticleTitle>The JWS online simulation database.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1589-1590</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1093/bioinformatics/btw831</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText Label="Summary" NlmCategory="UNASSIGNED">JWS Online is a web-based platform for construction, simulation and exchange of models in standard formats. We have extended the platform with a database for curated simulation experiments that can be accessed directly via a URL, allowing one-click reproduction of published results. Users can modify the simulation experiments and export them in standard formats. The Simulation database thus lowers the bar on exploring computational models, helps users create valid simulation descriptions and improves the reproducibility of published simulation experiments.</AbstractText>
                <AbstractText Label="Availability and Implementation" NlmCategory="UNASSIGNED">The Simulation Database is available on line at https://jjj.bio.vu.nl/models/experiments/ .</AbstractText>
                <AbstractText Label="Contact" NlmCategory="UNASSIGNED">jls@sun.ac.za .</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
